## Location
rust/lichen-rpl/src/dodag.rs:463

## Issue
```rust
pub fn select_parent(&mut self) {
    // SECURITY: Root nodes never select a parent - they ARE the DODAG root.
    // Early exit prevents state corruption from malicious DIOs with low ranks.
    if self.role == DodagRole::Root {
        return;  // line 449-451
    }
    // ... lines 452-461 ...
    let Some(best) = best else {
        if self.role != DodagRole::Root {  // line 463 - redundant
            // ...
        }
        return;
    };
}
```

The check `if self.role != DodagRole::Root` at line 463 is dead code because we already returned at line 449-451 if role was Root.

## Impact
No correctness issue. Minor readability concern - the redundant check suggests the early return might not be comprehensive, but it is.

## Suggested fix
Remove the redundant check:
```rust
let Some(best) = best else {
    let r = self.set_role(DodagRole::Unjoined);
    assert!(r.is_ok(), "joined DODAG can return to unjoined");
    self.preferred_parent = None;
    self.rank = INFINITE_RANK;
    return;
};
```
